<title>UK: Rank down on talk BZW placing 6 mln shares.</title>
<headline>Rank down on talk BZW placing 6 mln shares.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-01-16</dateline>
<text>
<p>Shares in Rank Group stumbled amid rumours that brokerage BZW was placing six million shares, dealers said.</p>
<p>By 1116 GMT, Rank shares were down 10-1/2p to 415p, as the FTSE 100 cleared the 4,200 barrier to a record high.  </p>
<p>Details were not immediately available.</p>
<p>--Debra Sherman, London newsroom +44 171 542 4026</p>
